    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Cannabis-Infused Summer Drink Recipes (non-alcoholic)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "id": "ac2b310",
   "doc": "wp-post#143422",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 5,
     "text": "Looking to elevate your summer in a refreshing and unique way?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Beat the heat with these chilled, non-alcoholic cannabis-infused drink recipes from <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA</strong>, featuring <a href=\"/brands/good-feels/\">Good Feels / Good Vibes syrups</a>, <a href=\"/brands/treeworks/\">Treeworks Drops</a> or <a href=\"/brands/chill-medicated/\">Chill Medicated syrups</a>. Whether you’re kicking back on the beach, hosting a backyard BBQ, or just soaking up the sun after a long day, our curated cannabis drink ideas are the perfect way to keep cool and unwind.</p><p>Crafted with high-quality, locally sourced ingredients and infused with premium cannabis extracts, these beverages bring a laid-back twist to your favorite summer sips. Think ice-cold lemonade with a mellow cannabis buzz, tropical fruit spritzers that sparkle with flavor, or a smooth iced tea with just the right touch of good vibes. Each recipe is designed to help you relax, recharge, and make the most of the season—one sip at a time.</p><p>At <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis</strong>, we’re proud to offer cannabis products that combine great taste with reliable quality. Our infused drinks are alcohol-free, making them ideal for those looking to enjoy a social and flavorful summer experience without the booze. With options ranging from fruity and tangy to light and herbal, there’s something to satisfy every taste.</p><p>Stop by <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet</strong> to browse our full lineup, including <a href=\"/brands/good-feels/\">Good Feels / Good Vibes syrups</a>, <a href=\"/brands/treeworks/\">Treeworks Drops</a> or <a href=\"/brands/chill-medicated/\">Chill Medicated syrups</a>. , and discover how to add a refreshing twist to your summer. If you’re searching for a <em>dispensary near me</em> while visiting Cape Cod, we’re your go-to destination for cannabis-infused beverages and more.</p><p><em><strong>And as always, we encourage you to enjoy responsibly—our beverages are for adults 21+, so sip smart and share the good vibes safely.</strong></em></p>"
    }
   ]
  },
