  {
   "n": 6,
   "id": "a8adbef",
   "doc": "wp-post#143422",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Twilight Orchard Breeze"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>INGREDIENTS:</p><ul><li>1 serving <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/?product=98bcef64-8732-4bac-9e6e-a84f98842852\">Good Vibes X Cranberry Pomegranate</a></li><li>1/2 cup fresh apple cider</li><li>1/4 cup sparkling mineral water</li><li>1 teaspoon honey (optional, for added sweetness)</li><li>Fresh cranberries and a sprig of rosemary for garnish</li></ul><p>INSTRUCTIONS:</p><ol><li>Fill a highball glass with ice and pour in the <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/?product=98bcef64-8732-4bac-9e6e-a84f98842852\">Good Vibes X Cranberry Pomegranate</a>.</li><li>Add the fresh apple cider and stir in the honey until well combined.</li><li>Top with the sparkling mineral water and gently stir for a refreshing fizz.</li><li>Garnish with a skewer of fresh cranberries and a sprig of rosemary to evoke the orchard’s twilight essence.</li></ol>"
    }
   ]
  },
