  {
   "n": 9,
   "id": "a17b395",
   "doc": "wp-post#143422",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Blue Raspberry Bliss Mocktail"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>INGREDIENTS:</p><ul><li>1 serving <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/?product=4e1668e1-339b-4ac9-bdc3-94cd76de3749\">Good Vibes Blue Raspberry</a></li><li>1/2 cup pineapple juice</li><li>1/4 cup coconut water</li><li>2 tablespoons fresh lime juice</li><li>1 teaspoon agave syrup (optional, for added sweetness)</li><li>1/4 cup club soda</li><li>Fresh blueberries for garnish</li><li>Crushed ice</li><li>Fresh mint leaves for garnish</li></ul><p>INSTRUCTIONS:</p><ol><li>In a cocktail shaker, combine 1 serving of <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/?product=4e1668e1-339b-4ac9-bdc3-94cd76de3749\">Good Vibes Blue Raspberry</a>, 1/2 cup pineapple juice, 1/4 cup coconut water, 2 tablespoons fresh lime juice, and 1 teaspoon agave syrup if desired. Shake well to blend the ingredients.</li><li>Fill a highball glass with crushed ice to the top.</li><li>Strain the mixture from the cocktail shaker into the glass over the crushed ice.</li><li>Top the mocktail with 1/4 cup club soda and stir gently to combine.</li><li>Garnish with fresh blueberries and mint leaves. Serve immediately and enjoy the refreshing flavors of Blue Raspberry Bliss Mocktail.</li></ol>"
    }
   ]
