   "doc": "wp-post#143422",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Strawberry Lemonade (Berry Bliss)"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>INGREDIENTS:</p><ul><li>Your favorite lemonade</li><li><a href=\"/brands/chill-medicated/?product=506bc068-8921-48a3-ba3d-0b0385eebcd7\">Chill Medicated Strawberry Syrup</a></li><li>Lemon wedge for garnish (optional)</li></ul><p>INSTRUCTIONS:</p><ol><li>Fill a 16oz cup about halfway with ice and pour in lemonade of your choice</li><li>Add the desired amount of <a href=\"/brands/chill-medicated/?product=506bc068-8921-48a3-ba3d-0b0385eebcd7\">Chill Medicated Strawberry Syrup</a>. Stir it together with a spoon.</li><li>Top your glass with a lemon wedge. Enjoy!</li></ol>"
    }
